	<div align=justify><font class="storytext"><P>This article comes from Cindy Adams gossip column at the <A href="http://www.nypost.com/seven/09242007/gossip/cindy/madge_gearing_up_for_50__new_t.htm" target=_blank>NY Post</A>. We'd like to note and correct Ms. Adams that <EM>The Confessions Tour</EM> last year had 60 shows, not 50 shows.<BR><BR><EM><STRONG>MADGE GEARING UP FOR 50 &amp; NEW TOUR<BR><BR></STRONG>September 24, 2007 -- THERE'S something about the number 50 that does it for Mrs. Guy Ritchie. Her tour last year was 50 dates. As we speak, let it be known that Her Very Own Self is gearing for yet another concert tour. The schlep now in the planning stage is to be called <STRONG>"Madonna at 50."</STRONG></EM></P>
