  <tr>
    <td bgcolor="#FFFFFF">
	<div align=justify><font class="storytext"><P>Our friend <STRONG>Raistalla</STRONG>, who danced with <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> in the <STRONG>re-Invention Tour</STRONG>, will be coming to <STRONG>Florence</STRONG>, <STRONG>Italy</STRONG>,&nbsp;to receive an award <BR>from the <STRONG>DigiFestival</STRONG>. </P>
<P>Thanks to your votes, <STRONG>Raistalla</STRONG> won the <STRONG>Digifestival.net 2007</STRONG> <STRONG>"Best Absolute Audience Winner"</STRONG>. <BR><BR>The <STRONG>DigiFestival.net 2007</STRONG> video promotion of <STRONG>"Shut It Down"</STRONG> will be shown during the final exhibits in <STRONG>Florence</STRONG>, and in all the partner events created around the world, on <STRONG>October 25-28th, 2007</STRONG> - <STRONG>Fortezza da Basso</STRONG>, <STRONG>Ghiaia Pavillon Florence</STRONG>, <STRONG>Italy</STRONG>. </P>
<P>Click on the links for more info:</P>
