  <tr>
    <td bgcolor="#FFFFFF">
	<div align=justify><font class="storytext"><P align=justify>French magazine "<STRONG>ENTREVUE</STRONG>" (means "<STRONG>INTERVIEW</STRONG>") celebrates its <STRONG>15 years</STRONG> publishing a special issue with the best interviews through the years.</P>
<P align=center>"<STRONG>ENTREVUE</STRONG>" magazine, it's: <BR><STRONG>1 770 interviews, 180 issues, and over 4 million readers each month!</STRONG></P>
<P align=center><A href="/public/ENTREVUE_p01_collector_issue_15years_cover.jpg" target=_blank><IMG height=356 src="/public/ENTREVUE_p01_collector_issue_15years_cover_small.jpg" width=285 border=0></A>&nbsp; <A href="/public/ENTREVUE_p02_collector_issue_15years.jpg" target=_blank><IMG height=356 src="/public/ENTREVUE_p02_collector_issue_15years_small.jpg" width=300 border=0></A></P>
<P align=center><STRONG>Interview with Madonna - 1992</STRONG></P>
<P align=center><A href="/public/ENTREVUE_p03_collector_issue_15years.jpg" target=_blank><IMG height=268 src="/public/ENTREVUE_p03_collector_issue_15years_small.jpg" width=600 border=0></A></P>
<P align=center><A href="/public/ENTREVUE_p04_collector_issue_15years_1992.jpg" target=_blank><IMG height=299 src="/public/ENTREVUE_p04_collector_issue_15years_1992_small.jpg" width=232 border=0></A>&nbsp; <IMG height=299 src="/public/ENTREVUE_p05_collector_issue_15years_1992_Madonna.jpg" width=236 border=0></P>
<P align=center><A href="/public/ENTREVUE_p06_collector_issue_15years_1992_Madonna.jpg" target=_blank><IMG height=381 src="/public/ENTREVUE_p06_collector_issue_15years_1992_Madonna_small.jpg" width=295 border=0></A>&nbsp;<A href="/public/ENTREVUE_p07_collector_issue_15years_1992_Madonna.jpg" target=_blank><IMG height=381 src="/public/ENTREVUE_p07_collector_issue_15years_1992_Madonna_small.jpg" width=300 border=0></A></P>
<P align=center><A href="/public/ENTREVUE_p08_collector_issue_15years_1992_Madonna.jpg" target=_blank><IMG height=386 src="/public/ENTREVUE_p08_collector_issue_15years_1992_Madonna_small.jpg" width=295 border=0></A>&nbsp;<A href="/public/ENTREVUE_p09_collector_issue_15years_1992_Madonna.jpg" target=_blank><IMG height=386 src="/public/ENTREVUE_p09_collector_issue_15years_1992_Madonna_small.jpg" width=300 border=0></A></P>
<P align=center><A href="/public/ENTREVUE_p10_collector_issue_15years_1994.jpg" target=_blank><IMG height=385 src="/public/ENTREVUE_p10_collector_issue_15years_1994_small.jpg" width=300 border=0></A>&nbsp; <IMG height=385 src="/public/ENTREVUE_p11_collector_issue_15years_1994.jpg" width=299 border=0></P>
<P align=center><STRONG>Interview with Salma Hayek - 1999</STRONG></P>
<P align=center><IMG height=242 src="/public/ENTREVUE_p12_collector_issue_15years_1999_Hayek.jpg" width=500 border=0></P>
<P align=center><A href="/public/ENTREVUE_p13_collector_issue_15years_1999_Hayek.jpg" target=_blank><IMG height=412 src="/public/ENTREVUE_p13_collector_issue_15years_1999_Hayek_small.jpg" width=300 border=0></A></P>
<P align=justify><STRONG>ENTREVUE:</STRONG> "You are going to play <STRONG>Frida Khalo</STRONG> in a movie."<BR><STRONG>Salma Hayek:</STRONG> "This woman was bisexual and a great artist. And I'm not afraid to do love scenes with a woman."</P>
<P align=justify><STRONG>ENTREVUE:</STRONG> "<STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> did everything to get the part, are you flattered to get it ?"<BR><STRONG>Salma Hayek:</STRONG> "<STRONG><FONT style="BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffff00">I don't think that Madonna was good for this part. Me, I can play it better than anyone else because I am Mexican</FONT><FONT style="BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffff00">.</FONT></STRONG>"</P>
<P align=center><STRONG>Interview with Christina Aguilera - 2004</STRONG></P>
<P align=center><IMG height=242 src="/public/ENTREVUE_p14_collector_issue_15years_2004_Aguilera.jpg" width=500 border=0></P>
<P align=center><IMG height=390 src="/public/ENTREVUE_p15_collector_issue_15years_2004_Aguilera.jpg" width=300 border=0></P>
<P align=justify><STRONG>ENTREVUE:</STRONG> "Do you think that you've ever been so strong ?"<BR><STRONG>Christina Aguilera:</STRONG> "To have stabs in the back made me stronger. And then, I'm not the first one. <FONT style="BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffff00"><STRONG>Look at Madonna, she has been criticized all her life and she is still on top. If she can do it, then so do I ! </STRONG></FONT><FONT style="BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff">"</FONT></P>
<P align=center><STRONG>Interview with Jennifer Lopez - 2005</STRONG></P>
<P align=center><IMG height=328 src="/public/ENTREVUE_p16_collector_issue_15years_2005_Lopez.jpg" width=500 border=0></P>
<P align=center><IMG height=415 src="/public/ENTREVUE_p17_collector_issue_15years_2005_Lopez.jpg" width=500 border=0></P>
<P align=justify><STRONG>ENTREVUE:</STRONG> "At 15 years old, were you as feminine as now?"<BR><STRONG>Jennifer Lopez:</STRONG> "<STRONG><FONT style="BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffff00">I had Madonna's look, until the day my mother saw I took a crucifix to put it in my bra ! </FONT></STRONG>"</P>
<P align=justify><EM>Translations: Claudine.</EM></P>
<DIV></DIV><IMG src="/corrispondenti/co-claudine.jpg" border=0>
</font></div>
